{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"tr-start","type":"text","text":"# Treasurer Workflow\n\nThe treasurer maintains the club's financial records, processes volunteer reimbursements, reconciles payments, and prepares the income/expense summary shared with the club leader.","x":0,"y":0,"width":380,"height":228,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"sign-in","type":"text","text":"## 1. Sign In\n\nOpen the club management system and sign in with an account that has the treasurer role.\n\n*DB: users, user_roles, roles*","x":0,"y":328,"width":380,"height":210},
		{"id":"valid-login","type":"text","text":"## Credentials valid and treasurer role?\n\nCheck the submitted credentials and confirm the account holds the treasurer role.","x":0,"y":638,"width":380,"height":170},
		{"id":"login-error","type":"text","text":"## No — Access denied\n\nShow an error. Let the user retry or use password recovery (suggested feature). Accounts without the treasurer role cannot open finance pages.","x":-460,"y":638,"width":380,"height":196,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"dashboard","type":"text","text":"## 2. Treasurer Dashboard\n\nReview the club's financial position at a glance:\n- Current balance (income − expenses)\n- Reimbursement claims waiting for review\n- Paid payments not yet in the ledger\n- Recent income and expense entries\n\n*DB: financial_transactions, expense_claims, payments*","x":0,"y":908,"width":380,"height":306,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"area-choice","type":"text","text":"## 3. Choose Finance Area\n\nSelect the financial task that needs attention.","x":0,"y":1314,"width":380,"height":148},
		{"id":"income","type":"text","text":"## A. Record Income\n\n- Review paid dues, ticket sales, and merchandise payments\n- Record fundraiser income\n- Assign a category (dues, tickets, merch, fundraiser)\n- Link the entry to its payment, event, or fundraiser\n\n*DB: payments → financial_transactions (income)*","x":-800,"y":1582,"width":360,"height":330},
		{"id":"reimb","type":"text","text":"## B. Review Reimbursements\n\n- Open the queue of submitted claims\n- Check amount, description, task, and receipts\n- Compare the claim with the task it belongs to\n- Decide whether the claim is valid\n\n*DB: expense_claims, expense_receipts, tasks, users*","x":-400,"y":1582,"width":360,"height":306},
		{"id":"expenses","type":"text","text":"## C. Record Other Expenses\n\n- Enter club costs not tied to a claim (venue, printing, supplies)\n- Choose a category and amount\n- Link to an event or fundraiser when relevant\n- Add notes or invoice details\n\n*DB: financial_transactions (expense)*","x":0,"y":1582,"width":360,"height":282},
		{"id":"reconcile","type":"text","text":"## D. Reconcile Payments\n\n- List paid payments with no ledger entry\n- Record the missing entries\n- Investigate failed or pending payments\n- Record refunds (e.g., cancelled tickets) as expenses\n\n*DB: payments LEFT JOIN financial_transactions*","x":400,"y":1582,"width":360,"height":330},
		{"id":"leader-data","type":"text","text":"## E. Review Leader Activity Data\n\n- Check ticket sales and attendance per event\n- Check merchandise orders and payment status\n- Check fundraiser results\n- Compare them against recorded income\n\n*DB: tickets, merch_orders, fundraisers, financial_transactions*","x":800,"y":1582,"width":360,"height":328},
		{"id":"claim-valid","type":"text","text":"## Claim valid?\n\nIs the expense legitimate, reasonable, and supported by a receipt where required?","x":-400,"y":1988,"width":360,"height":172},
		{"id":"verify","type":"text","text":"## 4. Verify the Ledger\n\nConfirm all new entries are categorised, linked to their source, and not double-counted.","x":0,"y":2662,"width":380,"height":172},
		{"id":"summary","type":"text","text":"## 5. Prepare Income/Expense Summary\n\nSummarise by month, category, event, and fundraiser. Show the net balance.\n\n*DB: v_financial_summary view over financial_transactions*","x":0,"y":2934,"width":380,"height":232,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"share","type":"text","text":"## 6. Coordinate with Club Leader\n\nShare the summary and flag issues such as low funds, unpaid dues, or delayed reimbursements. The leader reviews club status against it.","x":0,"y":3266,"width":380,"height":218},
		{"id":"more","type":"text","text":"## More finance work?\n\nDecide whether to handle another area or finish the session.","x":0,"y":3584,"width":380,"height":148},
		{"id":"sign-out","type":"text","text":"## 7. Sign Out\n\nEnd the treasurer session.","x":480,"y":3584,"width":320,"height":124},
		{"id":"approve","type":"text","text":"## Yes — Approve & Pay\n\n- Mark the claim approved\n- Pay the volunteer\n- Record the payout reference and paid date\n- Add the expense to the ledger\n\n*DB: expense_claims (approved → paid) → financial_transactions (expense)*","x":-880,"y":2552,"width":360,"height":282,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"reject","type":"text","text":"## No — Reject Claim\n\n- Mark the claim as rejected\n- Record the rejection reason\n- Volunteer sees the status and reason on their dashboard\n\n*DB: expense_claims.status = rejected*","x":-980,"y":2043,"width":360,"height":234,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
